OL,3,GNEWSAInquest reopens into schoolboy's
OL,4,Aunsolved murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest has reopened into the death
OL,7,Fof a 15-year-old who was last seen when
OL,8,Fhe rode his bike to fly a kite in 1984.
OL,10,FMark Billington's body was found two
OL,11,Fmonths later hanging in a tree in
OL,12,Fwoodland on the edge of Meriden, near
OL,13,FCoventry, nearly seven miles (11km)
OL,14,Ffrom his house in Yardley in
OL,15,FBirmingham.
OL,17,FPolice at the time treated his death as
OL,18,Fa suicide, however, it became a murder
OL,19,Finquiry in 2002. Nobody has ever been
OL,20,Fcharged.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
