OL,3,GNEWSAInquest reopens into schoolboy's
OL,4,Aunsolved murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpening the two-day proceedings on
OL,7,FMonday, senior coroner Louise Hunt read
OL,8,Fout a statement from his 85-year-old
OL,9,Ffather, Roy Billington, in which Mark
OL,10,Fwas described as "lovely" and a "quiet
OL,11,Flad" who loved animals, collecting
OL,12,Fstamps and riding his bike.
